  I'm not sure I understand your second paragraph.  The only supported
  way to link a program with threads is to use the driver and to
  specify -pthread.  It is not recommended that you call the linker
  directly to link threaded programs and it is not recommended that
  you link with libpthread.so directly.  Using the -pthread driver
  flag allows the driver to properly link with the threads library.

