Expert? Well, OK; you got it. As the person who architected and designed, 
and largely wrote, both DCE threads and the implementation of POSIX threads 
on "DEC OSF/1"/"Digital UNIX"/"Tru64 UNIX", I suppose I might just qualify.

> P.S: For those who are wondering why I might actually be still
