> that I'm targeting is a DCE application.

It's a tragedy that the DCE AES still calls out nonstandard and archaic "DCE 
threads". Unfortunately, OSF lost funding to maintain the AES before POSIX 
threads existed, so it's languished for 8 years in the dark ages.

